    "description": "Boats. Bay. Bridge. Ballpark. See it all from the most coveted southeast corner at 88 King Street. Resident 1122 is 3 bedrooms plus flex room/enclose-able den, 2 bath. Unobstructed Bay Bridge, Marina, Bay, and Ballpark views from floor-to-ceiling windows in every room. Thoughtfully designed with new paint (2025). Wide plank oak floors (2022), recently remodeled designer kitchen with custom soft-close cabinetry, stainless steel Sub-Zero and Miele appliances, soft close cabinetry, gas range.    Flex room used as separate dining room, can be enclosed as another bedroom or office! Spacious living room with a walkout balcony overlooking boats and the ballpark. The primary suite features dual vanity sinks, two guest bedrooms feature built-in closet systems, shared bath in the hallway, stacked washer/dryer in closet. Parking and storage included. Luxury amenities include a heated outdoor pool, hot tub, BBQ, landscaped plaza, gym, entertainment lounge, business center, and conference room. 24-hour doorman and security.  Steps from Muni T & N light rail lines, Muni bus lines, and Caltrain. Conveniently located off HWY-280 with easy access to groceries, cafes, bars nearby. Chase Center, Oracle Park, tech HQs all within the area."
  },
